      "layering_notes": "Negative finding for capital: the County has no HOME or CDBG construction pipeline of its own. The CDBG-funded studies matter because they are the County's first step toward sponsoring affordable multifamily or cottage housing on unincorporated sites under the 2023-2031 Housing Element (adopted Feb 6, 2024). A developer wanting state HOME in Dixon, Rio Vista or the unincorporated area needs the County or city to apply as grantee. HOME and CDBG carry Davis-Bacon (CDBG 8+ units, HOME 12+ units) and state prevailing wage.",
